# The drone firmware's factory sound, as the browser prototype's "Cinematic": three drones latched on
# over MIDI (DRONE on channel 10, GM drum notes: 36 DR1, 38 DR2, 41 DR3), a slow build, then a melody
# on MEL A (channel 2) into the shimmer reverb and the tape delay; a drone latched off again at the end.
# The audio is build/scenarios/drone/drone_demo.wav: listen against drone-proto/drone.html.
wait 300
wav drone_demo.wav
peakreset
midi 99 24 64
wait 3000
expect peak_db_min -40
midi 99 26 64
wait 2500
midi 99 29 64
wait 4000
midi 91 39 64
wait 900
midi 81 39 00
wait 600
midi 91 3C 64
wait 900
midi 81 3C 00
wait 600
midi 91 40 64
wait 1800
midi 81 40 00
wait 900
midi 91 3E 64
wait 900
midi 81 3E 00
wait 4000
midi 99 29 64
wait 6000
expect peak_db_max -0.5
shot drone.png
wavstop
